 iyo minthana” yaagees.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Goday asaa mazgaben xaafiya wode,","poem":1},{"text":"“Haysi Xiyoonen yeletis” yaagana. Salaha","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Enti yexishenne durishe,","poem":1},{"text":"“Nu anjo ubbay Xiyoonepe pultees” yaagana.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_ltw/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_ltw/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_ltw/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}